 informal_sample="""<p>Hi Oleg,</p><p>I'm so happy you're coming to visit! My town is much smaller than your city, but it's also quieter and cleaner. The old town is the most beautiful part, and it's less crowded than Riga. On the other hand, there aren't as many shops, so we'll have to take the bus to the mall.</p><p>The best time to visit is in July – it's the warmest month, so we can swim in the lake. Besides, there's a music festival on 14 July. It's the biggest event of the summer!</p><p>Let me know when you're arriving.<br>See you soon!<br>Madara</p>""",
